OL,3,AMultiple flights in Europe hit by
OL,4,A'malicious hoax threats', UK transport
OL,5,Asecretary says
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Prague, Czech police say no
OL,8,Fexplosives were found aboard four
OL,9,Fflights, following threats about an
OL,10,F"improvised explosive device"
OL,12,FAn aircraft was escorted into Rome
OL,13,FFiumicino Airport by Italian Air Force
OL,14,Fjets, while the Bulgarian military says
OL,15,Fits jets escorted three aircraft to
OL,16,FSofia
OL,18,FOn-board messages analysed by BBC
OL,19,FVerify show one diverted aircraft -
OL,20,Ftravelling from Dublin to Rome - was
OL,21,Falerted to a threat by air traffic
OL,22,Fcontrol
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
